OL,3,ABurnham promises more devolution and
OL,4,Apublic control of essential services
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe reiterated his belief that political
OL,7,Fpower had been centralised and
OL,8,Fannounced he would be making devolution
OL,9,Fpowers available to more areas in
OL,10,FEngland.
OL,12,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,13,Faccused Burnham of offering "more
OL,14,Fgovernment control, more taxes and more
OL,15,Fpoliticians".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
