OL,3,AUS launches more strikes on Iran as
OL,4,Astate media reports explosions
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmerican forces resumed strikes against
OL,7,FIran on Tuesday, US Central Command has
OL,8,Fsaid in a statement.
OL,10,FIt accused the Islamic Revolutionary
OL,11,FGuard Corps (IRGC) of "recent attempted
OL,12,Fattacks" against commercial shipping in
OL,13,Fthe Strait of Hormuz and "American
OL,14,Fservice members deployed to the
OL,15,Fregion".
OL,17,FShortly afterwards Donald Trump warned
OL,18,Fthat Iran would be hit again at "a much
OL,19,Fharder and higher level" if it
OL,20,Fretaliated.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
